{"ref":"character:shapeshifter-nino","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Impostor_Rina.gif","w":40,"h":53}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Emergency Meeting)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Shapeshifter Nino is a playable character from the Emergency Meeting DLC of Vampire Survivors. Their starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Just_Vent.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:just-vent"}," ",{"t":"Just Vent","r":"weapon:just-vent"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["18 December 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Shapeshifter"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["C1_SHAPESHIFTER"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["C1_Shapeshifter"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Just_Vent.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:just-vent"}," ",{"t":"Just Vent","r":"weapon:just-vent"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Evolve the Science Rocks"]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Hide_and_Survive.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Hide and Survive\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Recovery","cells":[["1.00"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+10%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Shapeshifter is unlocked for purchase by evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Science_Rocks.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:science-rocks"}," ",{"t":"Science Rocks","r":"weapon:science-rocks"},". They need to be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 500, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Shapeshifter can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"greenisredyouisme\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Shapeshifter starts with +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"}," and +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["When damaged, Shapeshifter Nino has a 20% chance, affected by ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", to change into one of 8 forms:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Shapeunshifter.png","w":19,"h":19}," Shapeunshifter / \"normal\" form: Gains +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Pinthot_&_Coldellini.png","w":17,"h":19}," Pinthot Form: Triggers a ",{"i":"Sprite-Fire_Nova.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fire-nova"}," ",{"t":"Fire Nova","r":"weapon:fire-nova"},". Gains +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Pinthot_&_Coldellini-2.png","w":17,"h":19}," Coldellini Form: Triggers an ",{"i":"Sprite-Ice_Nova.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:ice-nova"}," ",{"t":"Ice Nova","r":"weapon:ice-nova"},". Gains +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Space_Apparition.png","w":15,"h":16}," Space Apparition Form: Triggers a ",{"i":"Sprite-Fear_Nova.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fear-nova"}," ",{"t":"Fear Nova","r":"weapon:fear-nova"},". Gains +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["The following forms are identical in effect and are considered \"sus\" forms. \"Sus\" forms will randomly be chosen out of the following:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Meat_Bean.png","w":24,"h":24}," Meat Bean Form: Gains +8 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Suspicio.png","w":18,"h":17}," Suspicio (trash bin) Form: Gains +8 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Suspicio-2.png","w":24,"h":24}," Suspicio (brick) Form: Gains +8 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Suspicio-3.png","w":15,"h":13}," Suspicio (nugget) Form: Gains +8 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Swapping forms can happen at a maximum of once every 5 seconds, reduced by 25% of ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},". Shapeshifter Nino cannot swap to the same form that they currently are. When swapping forms, Shapeshifter Nino will release a body part. These body parts will heal Shapeshifter Nino for a minimum of 8 Health and can heal more depending on Shapeshifter Nino's ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", scaling infinitely."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Unlike other food-related pickups, body parts will not have their healing increased by ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},"."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Shapeshifter Nino can gain a maximum of +300 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," from shapeshifting."]},{"k":"p","c":["Shapeshifter Nino modifies their set of \"nova\" weapons in the following ways:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["All novas gain +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"}," when Shapeshifter Nino levels up 10 times."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Fire_Nova.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fire-nova"}," ",{"t":"Fire Nova","r":"weapon:fire-nova"}," has its base damage doubled to 20, and gains +10 base damage every 10 levels."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Ice_Nova.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:ice-nova"}," ",{"t":"Ice Nova","r":"weapon:ice-nova"}," has its base damage halved to 5, and its freeze chance set to 50%, down from 100%, but will gain +10% freeze chance every 10 levels."]}]},{"k":"p","c":["Note that these bonuses are only applied every 10 levels, not every level. These scalings will stop after Shapeshifter Nino has reached level 100."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Shapeshifter's excess body parts can be weaponized with ",{"t":"Sarabande of Healing (VI)","r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"},", though its efficacy diminishes as the run progresses."]},{"c":["The body parts Shapeshifter drops act similar to Floor Chickens when interacting with ",{"t":"Gatti Amari","r":"weapon:gatti-amari"},"."]},{"c":["Weapons and Arcana that can retaliate such as ",{"i":"Sprite-NO_FUTURE.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:no-future"}," ",{"t":"NO FUTURE","r":"weapon:no-future"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Victory_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:victory-sword"}," ",{"t":"Victory Sword","r":"weapon:victory-sword"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Night_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:night-sword"}," ",{"t":"Night Sword","r":"weapon:night-sword"},"/",{"i":"Sprite-Muramasa.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:muramasa"}," ",{"t":"Muramasa","r":"weapon:muramasa"},", ",{"t":"Eskizzibur","r":"weapon:eskizzibur"},"/",{"i":"Sprite-Legionnaire.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:legionnaire"}," ",{"t":"Legionnaire","r":"weapon:legionnaire"},", and ",{"t":"Heart of Fire (XIX)","r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"}," can be used to capitalize off of the trigger condition of Shapeshifter's ability. Retaliatory attacks can be further enhanced with ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"},"."]},{"c":["The evolution of Shapeshifter's starting weapon, ",{"i":"Sprite-Unjust_Ejection.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:unjust-ejection"}," ",{"t":"Unjust Ejection","r":"weapon:unjust-ejection"},", can capture more enemies in its area of effect by moving to the left or right in the opposite direction. ",{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:wings"}," ",{"t":"Wings","r":"passive:wings"}," can increase the number of ejected enemies, and horizontal weapons such as ",{"t":"Whip","r":"weapon:whip"},"/",{"t":"Vento Sacro","r":"weapon:vento-sacro"},"/",{"t":"Fuwalafuwaloo","r":"weapon:fuwalafuwaloo"},", ",{"t":"Glass Fandango","r":"weapon:glass-fandango"},"/",{"t":"Celestial Voulge","r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Silver_Wind.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:silver-wind"}," ",{"t":"Silver Wind","r":"weapon:silver-wind"},"/",{"i":"Sprite-Festive_Winds.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:festive-winds"}," ",{"t":"Festive Winds","r":"weapon:festive-winds"}," can help cleave through incoming enemies while doing so."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Shapeshifter_Nino.png","w":120,"h":116,"c":["Shapeshifter Nino's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Shapeshifter_Nino.gif","w":120,"h":116,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Shapeshifter","x":"https://among-us.fandom.com/wiki/Shapeshifter"}," at the ",{"t":" Among Us Wiki","x":"https://among-us.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}